{"overview":"«پامپک»، آخرین دختر روی زمین و تنها بازماندهٔ طاعونی که بشریت را نابود کرد، در آستانهٔ هالووین در بیابان به دنبال لوازم ضروری می‌گردد. مراسم تنهایی او در این شب توسط یک باند وحشی از غارتگران به رهبری ترسناک «تالیا» که به درش می‌رسند، مختل می‌شود. با تعداد کمتر و تنها اسلحه‌های شیرینی، هوش و سلاح‌های خود، پامپک باید به‌طرز خشن برای بقا در شب بجنگد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Pumpkin, the last girl on earth and sole survivor of a humanity-ending plague, scavenging the wasteland for supplies on the eve of Halloween. Pumpkin’s lonely holiday ritual is interrupted by the arrival of a savage gang of raiders at her doorstep, led by the fearsome Thalia. Outnumbered and armed with candy, wit and weapons, Pumpkin must ferociously fight back to survive the night.","tagline_en":"The whole world is a haunted house.","runtime":80,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Ben Sottak"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Milly Shapiro","role":"Pumpkin","photo":"/5QVwZttyqVDl0M3AKwe0SDU8S5R.jpg"},{"name":"Shannyn Sossamon","role":"Thalia","photo":"/h7oiKMaoq0J5DM3PBZxffF9uJo4.jpg"},{"name":"Ajani Russell","role":"Wendy","photo":"/8AsPogz7iLDmKIQqeRf24UAQsEs.jpg"},{"name":"AJ Bowen","role":"Royce","photo":"/fGSSDkxLOkaUNj1VLHEg6ZPi3Jw.jpg"},{"name":"Victor Plajas","role":"","photo":"/mWnrtjy3TEmlMzGEILCuXIOjrWs.jpg"},{"name":"Taylor Valentine Lupini","role":"","photo":"/pyBl3OUxzMrggYyPm0sEUgHwGiq.jpg"},{"name":"Logan Beveridge","role":"","photo":""},{"name":"Bobby McFarlane","role":"","photo":"/oz4Yi1FfZ26UY9ZbYedpyneBNW5.jpg"}],"trailer":"peeB2FxGgIY","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1393929-hallowarrior/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Philo","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/mfbhzQwmQKjm7bLZPF5CTeu3Ilc.png"},{"n":"AMC Plus Apple TV channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/wLl5LRLVC6UOSaUlsmuzY0H9LS1.png"},{"n":"AMC+ Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tg5ufQ1GkYDCMxSSxemfeKWcvRe.png"},{"n":"AMC+","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/